\label{localdiminequality}
Let $D$ be a domain and $\star$ a semistar operation on $D$. Then
the following conditions are equivalent:
\begin{itemize}
\item[(1)] $D$ satisfy
the $\widetilde{\star}$-dimension formula (resp.
$\widetilde{\star}$-dimension inequality formula);

\item[(2)] $D_P$
satisfy the dimension formula for each
$P\in\operatorname{QSpec}^{\widetilde{\star}}(D)$ (resp. dimension inequality
formula);

\item[(3)] $D_M$
satisfy the dimension formula for each
$M\in\operatorname{QMax}^{\widetilde{\star}}(D)$ (resp. dimension inequality
formula).
\end{itemize}
